* LT3094 Negative LDO -5V Output
.lib LT3094.sub

* Input voltage source: -7V at IN node
VIN IN 0 -7

* LT3094 Subcircuit Instantiation
* Pin Order: IN EN/UVLO PG ILIM PGFB VIOC SET GND OUT
X1 IN IN NC_PG 0 0 NC_VIOC SET 0 OUT LT3094

* SET Resistor: VOUT = -100uA * RSET -> -5V = -100uA * 50k
RSET SET 0 50k

* Input and Output Capacitors
CIN 0 IN 10u
COUT 0 OUT 10u

* Light Resistive Load (5mA at -5V)
RLOAD 0 OUT 1k

* Dummy resistors to prevent floating node errors on unused pins
RPG NC_PG 0 1G
RVIOC NC_VIOC 0 1G

* Analysis directive for DC/settled output
.tran 5m
.end
